{"alignments": [{"id": "PSA.48.2.a001", "note": "Adjective is the clause's predicate; the construction-supplied 'Is' joins it under rule 20, discontinuous under rule 25. Competing home for the copula: מְשׂוֹשׂ as second appositional predicate.", "source": ["WLC.PSA.48.2.001"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.48.2.001", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t001", "t010"], "target_head": "t001"}, {"id": "PSA.48.2.a002", "note": "Rectum of יְפֵה; ASV recasts the construct relation with 'in' (rule 19).", "source": ["WLC.PSA.48.2.002"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.48.2.002", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t002", "t003"], "target_head": "t003"}, {"id": "PSA.48.2.a003", "note": "Construct noun takes supplied 'the' (rule 29).", "source": ["WLC.PSA.48.2.003"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.48.2.003", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t004", "t005"], "target_head": "t005"}, {"id": "PSA.48.2.a004", "note": "כֹּל is the rectum of מְשׂוֹשׂ and takes the chain's 'of' (rule 19) together with its own 'whole', discontinuous around the article's 'the'.", "source": ["WLC.PSA.48.2.004"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.48.2.004", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t006", "t008"], "target_head": "t008"}, {"id": "PSA.48.2.a005", "note": "", "source": ["WLC.PSA.48.2.005"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.48.2.005", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t007"], "target_head": "t007"}, {"id": "PSA.48.2.a006", "note": "", "source": ["WLC.PSA.48.2.006"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.48.2.006", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t009"], "target_head": "t009"}, {"id": "PSA.48.2.a007", "note": "", "source": ["WLC.PSA.48.2.007"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.48.2.007", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t011"], "target_head": "t011"}, {"id": "PSA.48.2.a008", "note": "ASV renders the chain appositionally ('mount Zion'), no 'of' written.", "source": ["WLC.PSA.48.2.008"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.48.2.008", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t012"], "target_head": "t012"}, {"id": "PSA.48.2.a009", "note": "Bare appositional nominal; supplied italic 'on' goes t